          "kicker": "Eligibility watch",
          "heading": "Koli Sewabu confirms Fiji Rugby is watching Mark Nawaqanitawase's possible switch",
          "body": "Fiji Rugby's chief executive Koli Sewabu says the union is following developments closely after Mark Nawaqanitawase's agent said the winger is weighing a switch of allegiance. The former Wallaby is eligible for Fiji, Italy and Australia. Sewabu said: \"We are aware of the potential switch Mark could make at the next World Cup and follow this with interest,\" adding that there would be genuine interest from Fiji Rugby. Wallabies coach Les Kiss says he will wait until the end of the year to see where Nawaqanitawase sits."
