          "kicker": "Rivalry revisited",
          "heading": "Kitshoff verifies Etzebeth's claim Irish reacted arrogantly after 2023 Dublin match",
          "body": "Springboks great Steven Kitshoff has confirmed Eben Etzebeth's claim that Ireland reacted arrogantly to South Africa after their 2023 World Cup pool match in Dublin. The retired prop, now promoting his memoir Kitsie: Memoir of a Bomb-Squad Bok, also explains why the rivalry flared after South Africa's 2017 loss in Dublin. Kitshoff, who retired in 2025 because of injury, describes how quickly the Springboks made a rival's comment personal, a theme the book sets against Scotland's Finn Russell."
