          "heading": "Italy have lost four straight, the latest 57-10 to Australia in July",
          "body": "Italy have lost four straight, and the one win in their last five games came before that run began. The most recent defeat was a 57-10 loss away to Australia in July's Nations Championship group stage. The Azzurri's next match is against South Africa, a chance to end a run that now stands at four straight defeats."
