          "heading": "Scotland face New Zealand in Round 4 after 33-17 win over Fiji",
          "body": "Scotland's next fixture is Round 4 against New Zealand. Their last meeting was a 25-17 defeat at home in November 2025, in an International Friendlies match. Going into the weekend, Scotland are 5 of 12 in the log after three matches, with two wins and one defeat. Across those three games they have scored 108 points and conceded 97, a difference of +11. Their most recent result was a 33-17 win over Fiji in Round 3."
