          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Wales centre Ben Thomas set to miss Nations start with calf injury",
          "body": "Wales centre Ben Thomas is set to miss the start of the Nations Championship with a calf injury, though Cardiff team-mate and Wales number eight Taulupe Faletau is expected to feature before the tournament returns. Cardiff head coach Corniel van Zyl says Thomas should still be part of the tournament but may not recover for the first or second game. The 27-year-old has played 19 internationals and shared the number 12 role with Joe Hawkins in 2026, while Eddie James, usually picked at outside centre, is an option at inside centre."
        },
