          "kicker": "2035 World Cup bid",
          "heading": "Argentina join Uruguay, Chile and Brazil in joint 2035 World Cup bid",
          "body": "Argentina are part of a four-nation South American bid to host the 2035 Rugby World Cup, alongside Uruguay, Chile and Brazil, with submissions reported in early October. The joint bid faces competition from Spain, whose plan includes the Nou Camp and Bernabéu, and coverage frames it as a test of World Rugby's stated desire for a European return. World Rugby will decide the host, so the Pumas' interest lies in whether a four-nation South American bid can beat a European one."
        },
